---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/container.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | CareBridge Health">
  <Container>
    <div class="mt-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-slate">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last Updated: January 2026</p>

      <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
      <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you fill out a form, book a consultation, or communicate with us via WhatsApp. This includes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name and Contact Data (Email, Phone).</li>
        <li>Health Data: Medical reports or photos you choose to share for assessment.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2. How We Use Your Data</h3>
      <p>We use your data solely to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide medical quotes from our partner hospitals.</li>
        <li>Schedule video consultations.</li>
        <li>Assist with travel logistics (visas, hotels).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>3. Data Sharing</h3>
      <p><strong>We do not sell your data.</strong> We only share your medical data with the specific hospital/doctor you are inquiring about to get a treatment plan.</p>

      <h3>4. Security</h3>
      <p>We use Tawk.to for chat and Calendly for scheduling. Both services are GDPR compliant. Your data is encrypted in transit.</p>

      <h3>5. Contact Us</h3>
      <p>For privacy concerns, email: support@carebridge-health.com</p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>